						<<love $penny -1>>
						
						<<btnLink "Continue" "Home">>
					<</replace>>\
				<</button>>@@
			</span>
		<<else>>\
			''You take the lift up to the top floor, breathing in the night air. It's dirty, but after spending a day underground you'll take anything.

			<<if flag($tasha,"FirstClubVisit")>>\
