:: Story-CH1-SophieDinner1 {"position":"725,22475","size":"100,100"}
''As you approach the elevator doors to head home, you're a little surprised to see $sophie.name standing in the lobby waiting for you.''

    <<pic $sophie>>\

    <<nm $sophie "Ah, $player.sophieName. Heading home?">>\

    <<nm $player "Hey $sophie.name. Well, I was going to, but...">>\

    ''$sophie.name smiles.''

    <<nm $sophie "But you think your plans are about to change? Well, you'd be right. Do you want to know a secret, <<Mr>> $player.surname? About... myself?">>\

    ''You begin to tense up slightly as $sophie.name approaches, now standing nearly toe to toe with you.''

    <<nm $player "I-I, um, yes?">>\

    ''She leans in.''

    <<nm $sophie "The truth is... Well you see...">>\

    ''$sophie.name backs away, gliding back to the elevator. She spins around with a bright smile on her face, something you don't think you've ever seen from her before. It's enough to catch you off guard.''

    <<nm $sophie "The truth is, <<Mr>> $player.surname, I simply cannot resist a good steak! And I mean a 'real' steak. Most people just assume I'm the fine dining, oysters and caviar type, or maybe those obnoxious little fillet cubes... No, no. Give me a 16 ounce rib-eye and a side of baked potato in a loud, smoky steakhouse and I'm truly, //truly// content.">>\

    <<nm $player "...">>\

    ''You can't help it, seeing the expression on $sophie.name's face along with a completely unexpected break of character sends you doubling over in laughter. It's too much, and before you know it you've fallen to the floor, clutching your side.''

    <<nm $sophie "<<Mr>> $player.surname!">>\

    <<nm $player "I'm... Oh, man, I'm sorry... I just... Aha! Hooo... Y-yeah... I'm good now...">>\

    <<nm $sophie "Hmph... ANYWAY, if you're finished... I tend to treat myself after particularly stressful weeks, and despite this week being only two days in, I think it qualifies. And, since your actions were pivotal to our continued employment with The Company, I thought I would extend you an invitation to join me tonight. In fact, I insist on it.">>\

    ''Not one to argue with your boss, you follow $sophie.name into the elevator and head up to the surface. The two of you step into a company vehicle where $sophie.name instructs the driver to take the both of you to 'the usual place'. After about twenty minutes of silence, the SUV parks in front of the Rippin' Steer Steakhouse. You can't help but give $sophie.name an amused look.''

    <<nm $sophie "Don't you judge. Come on, let's go.">>\

    ''You follow her out of the vehicle and into the steakhouse.''

    <<btnLink "Continue" "Story-CH1-SophieDinner2">>


:: Story-CH1-SophieDinner2 {"position":"850,22475","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Steakhouse>>\

	''You're greeted at the entrance by a young waitress who immediately recognizes $sophie.name.''

	<<nm $girl "Sophie! Welcome back!">>\

	<<nm $sophie "Hello dear. Table for two this time, a booth in the back if you have one.">>\

	''She grabs two menus and motions for you to follow.''

	<<nm $girl "Right this way!">>\

	''You take in the atmosphere as you're led through the restaurant. Tables and booths are filled with couples and families, while patrons at the bar drink out of bottles and shout at the TV. Country music plays loudly over the speakers while the smell of smoke and charcoal fill the air. You feel right at home in a place like this, but you're still getting over just how comfortable $sophie.name seems right now.''

	<<nm $girl "Your table. Here's our specials menu and your server will be with you shortly. Enjoy!">>\

	''With a warm smile, the woman disappears.''

	<<nm $player "Well... This is... nice...">>\

	<<nm $sophie "Indeed! Things have been quite eventful lately, and I think a break is well deserved.">>\

	''Before you can respond, your server appears next to your table. You both ask for water, and $sophie.name requests a bottle of wine.''

	<<nm $sophie "Do you know what you want to eat?">>\

	<<nm $player "Hm? Oh, um, I mean, I'll just have whatever you're having.">>\

	<<nm $sophie "Very well. My colleague and I will each take the eight ounce sirloin, medium rare, with a side of... baked potato?">>\

	<<nm $player "Sounds good to me.">>\

	''The server takes your order, returning a moment later with waters, empty wine glasses, and a bottle of red wine. $sophie.name pours you each a glass.''

	<<nm $player "So, I gotta say. I'm surprised at how relaxed you seem right now. At the office you're always so... professional.">>\

	<<nm $sophie "Is that so? Hm... Maybe this was a mistake, then?">>\

	<<nm $player "Oh, no! I just mean, it's nice to see that at the end of the day you're, ah...">>\

	<<nm $sophie "Human? Ha, yes well... In any case, I wanted to express my gratitude for the way you handled Ms. Lane. It was my hope that you and $penny.name would come up with something to show the executives, but, even I couldn't have predicted you'd put on such a show.">>\

	''You choke on your water.''

	<<nm $sophie "Oh, don't worry. Truth be told I never cared much for Ms. Lane anyway. That said, don't think I didn't notice the look in your eyes as you broke her down...">>\

	<<nm $player "I'm... not sure I know what you mean?">>\

	''$sophie.name sips at her wine.''

	<<nm $sophie "Hm, I think you know exactly what I mean. The thrill of imposing complete and utter control over someone's life. The power. The thrill. I think, deep down, this is exactly what motivates you.">>\

	''You quietly sip at your wine, considering $sophie.name's words.''

	<<nm $sophie "On a related note, the drug you used on Ms. Lane... I don't recall you ever showing me anything like that before. Is it new?">>\

	<<nm $player "Oh, you mean the $serum[4].name. It's new, yeah, $penny.name and I worked to have it prepared for the meeting, though, I didn't originally plan on using it that way... It causes its user to accept and follow a single command indefinitely and unquestionably. On the outside $tory.name happily executed the order, but on the inside she was probably screaming, unable to control her body anymore.">>\

	<<nm $sophie "That's quite extraordinary! Perhaps we should simply focus all of our resources into mass producing this new serum exclusively.">>\

	''She takes another sip of wine.''

	<<nm $player "Well, maybe, but it doesn't carry the same level of 'willing' obedience that something like $serum[1].name does. More importantly, the formula itself is still very inefficient, meaning each single dose takes a great deal of time and resources...">>\

	<<nm $sophie "Ah, I see. Well, with any luck we should start to see more funding coming in soon... Ah, our meal has arrived!">>\

	''The server returns with your plates, laying them out on the table in front of you. You can't help but smile in response to $sophie.name's overjoyed expression as she lifts her fork and steak knife.''

	<<nm $sophie "Enough shop talk. Let's eat!">>\

	''The two of you eat, and chat, and drink, and seem to be having a genuinely good time together. It's somewhat reassuring to see $sophie.name let loose a little bit, given how reserved she tends to be at the office. Before you know it, your plates are cleared.''

	<<nm $player "Oh man, that was great!">>\

	<<nm $sophie "Wasn't it? Ahhh... Now, if you'll excuse me...">>\

	''$sophie.name gets up from her seat rather quickly and starts walking towards the bathroom. You lean back in your seat, allowing your hands to fall to your sides.''

	<<nm $player "Hm?">>\

	''You pull a small vial out of your pocket.''

	<<nm $player "Must have forgotten about this... Actually...">>\

	''The wine glass across the table is still half full, and $sophie.name's judgment is more than a little compromised at this point. You start to consider the opportunity in front of you.''
    
    <<btnChoice "Put the serum in her drink" "Story-CH1-SophieDinnerDose">>
    <<btnChoice "Don't spike her drink" "Story-CH1-SophieDinnerSkip">>


