    ''$tory.name skips towards the door, heading off to her new life.''

    <<nm $james "Well... I didn't expect to be losing 'Ms. L' so early in the game, but... It won't be a problem. Sophie and her new pet have made things much more interesting...">>\
    <<AddConvo $penny 6>>\

    <<btnLink "Continue..." "Room-Sleep">>


:: Story-CH2-JuliaLeavesLab {"position":"850,22850","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Lab>>\

''You arrive at the office and decide to head straight for the lower floor. As you exit the lift, you notice $julia.name leaving your lab before quickly walking back to her office. She's welcome in the lab any time, but this is the first time you've actually seen her there. She doesn't appear to notice you as she closes the door to the medical office.''

<<Thought "That was unusual. Maybe I'll ask her about it later.">>\

''Before you can make it back to your lab, the lift doors open again.''

<<nm $penny "*yawn* Morning $player.name!">>\

<<nm $player "Morning $penny.name. Hey, do you usually see $julia.name in the lab?">>\

<<Thought "$penny.name thinks for a moment.">>\

<<nm $penny "I mean, maybe once or twice to say good morning, but she's usually not very social. Otherwise, no. Why?">>\

<<nm $player "...No reason. Ready to get to work?">>\

<<SetFlag $julia "seeLeaveLab">>\
<<if isMorning()>>\
	<<btnLink "Continue" "Lab" "passTime()">>
<<else>>\
	<<btnLink "Continue" "Lab">>
<</if>>\


:: Story-CH2-SophieTalk1 {"position":"975,22850","size":"100,100"}
''$sophie.name approaches you before you board the lift, trying her best to exude her usual confidence, and just missing the mark.''

<<pic $sophie>>\

<<nm $sophie "<<Mr>> $player.surname, it would appear you and I will be parting ways soon. Our client is unwilling to make any further alternative arrangements for his order, and I have been informed by corporate that failure to follow through with this deal will result in the immediate disbandment of this branch.">>\

''You don't know how to respond. Before you get the chance, $penny.name turns the corner, clearly having heard everything $sophie.name just said. She, too, remains silent. $sophie.name turns to face both of you.''

<<nm $sophie "You two will be absorbed into The Company's central R&D division, where you will continue the work you started here. I expect you'll both be treated well, though your new positions will carry much greater responsibility and much, much less leniency. $julia.name will likely join you as a medical advisor.<br><br><<if $john.isMale>>$john.name and $tasha.name, as well as myself, are being held responsible for this incident, and will be… dealt with… accordingly...<<else>>Given $john.name's… condition… she will be given to The Company for further observation and experimentation. $tasha.name and I are being held responsible for this incident, and will be… dealt with… accordingly…<</if>>">>\

<<nm $player "$sophie.name… We'll figure something out, we have to. We played it close to the wire with Tory, too, but we turned it around. I…">>\

<<nm $sophie "I'm sorry, $player.name, but I don't see that happening this time. It's unfortunate things had to work out this way, but... Anyway, I'll see you both in the office tomorrow. We haven't been shuttered yet, and until we are it's business as usual.">>\

''With that, $sophie.name exits onto the lift, going up alone. After the doors close, you approach and wait for it to return.''

<<nm $penny "You… Go on ahead. I have some things I want to work on here, help clear my head. I might call you tonight, would that be okay?">>\

<<nm $player "Yeah, of course. I'll see you…">>\

''The ride up to the surface feels longer than you remember, leaving you with an uncomfortable amount of time alone with yourself.''

<<Thought "Fuck! Everything was going so well, where the hell did all this come from? I mean, yeah, I know I work for an evil human trafficking organization who beats people into submission, and, yeah, I know it took these last couple weeks for that to really sink in, but… Fuck! Evil, wrong, an atrocity against human rights, maybe, no, definitely, but I finally found a place where it actually feels like I belong, and now...">>\

''You fall back against one of the cold walls of the elevator, having worn yourself out mentally. As you reach the surface you attempt to shake it off, keeping quiet during your ride home and heading straight for your bed.

<<img "room" "Bedroom">>\

After a few hours, your phone starts ringing, waking you up.''

<<Thought "..$penny.name?">>\

<<btnLink [[Answer the phone|Story-CH2-PennyTalk1]]>>


:: Story-CH2-PennyTalk1 {"position":"1100,22850","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Room>>\

<<nm $penny "$player.name? Hello?">>\

<<nm $player "Yeah... hey, what's up? What time is it?">>\

<<nm $penny "I dunno, probably pretty late, can we meet up somewhere? I have something I need to talk to you about.">>\

''You sit up, trying to get yourself together.''

<<Thought "...It's 2:00 am...">>\

<<nm $player "Sure... $penny.name... Where do you want to meet?">>\

<<nm $penny "There's a little diner a few blocks away from my apartment, Rhonda's, do you know it?">>\

<<nm $player "Yeah, I know it.">>\

<<nm $penny "Great, I'll be there in about 20 minutes. See you soon!">>\

''She hangs up before you can respond.''

<<Thought "So much for sleeping tonight...">>\

<<btnLink [[Go to Rhonda's Diner|Story-CH2-PennyTalk2]]>>


:: Story-CH2-PennyTalk2 {"position":"1225,22850","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Diner>>\

''You walk into the small diner, still half asleep. You're only slightly surprised to see that, even at this hour, there's a fair amount of patrons. It doesn't take you long to spot $penny.name in the corner, giving you a subtle wave.''

<<nm $penny "Thanks a lot for coming. Here, I ordered you some coffee.">>\

<<nm $player "Thanks.">>\

''You happily accept her gift and start drinking.''

<<nm $player "So…">>\

<<nm $penny "So… Okay, so I was talking to some of the other girls in the office, and apparently something really similar to what's happening now, happened a couple years ago. Just before a high profile sale was about to go down, the girls that were about to be sold started dying. Same cause of death and everything.">>\

<<nm $player "I'm… new to this, but wouldn't you think that in this line of work it's kind of, I don't know, expected? I mean, it's really shitty, yeah, but…">>\

<<nm $penny "No, I know what you mean, but I was talking to $diana.name and the higher-ups take this sort of thing super seriously. To them, the girls are just product, and a loss of product means a loss of profit and that's something they won't tolerate. Everyone involved with the training of the girls is rigorously vetted and further trained on how to do their jobs without harming the product too much. Even girls who just can't be trained are repurposed in some way. Nothing goes to waste, y'know?">>\

''Before you can respond, a waitress shows up to your table.''

@@.men;
<<Pro "UnknownF">>Waitress:<hr>
	You two decide on a meal yet? Or will it just be coffee tonight?@@\

<<nm $penny "Oh! Yeah, actually, um… The three-egg chorizo omelette comes with hashbrowns, right? Great! I'll take that, um, with an extra side of hashbrowns.">>\

@@.men;
<<Pro "UnknownF">>Waitress:<hr>
	You got it, hun. And for you?@@\

<<nm $player "I'm good with coffee, thanks. Actually, I could use some more if you don't mind topping me off.">>\

@@.men;
<<Pro "UnknownF">>Waitress:<hr>
	Sure thing, dear. You look like the walkin' dead, how about I just leave a pot on the table for you.@@\

<<nm $player "That would be… just fantastic. Thank you.">>\

@@.men;
<<Pro "UnknownF">>Waitress:<hr>
	Okay you two, I'll have all that out for you in a jiff'!@@\

''After she walks away, you resume your conversation.''

<<nm $player "Okay, so what you're saying is that these girls shouldn't be dying, like ever, and also that the timing seems fishy to you? I mean, everything you've said does make sense… What happened last time?">>\

<<nm $penny "I guess when this happened in the past, corporate bailed this branch out. They transferred one of the girls they had finished training that just happened to match what the client was looking for. I heard they were pretty pissed about it, and shortly after the incident the entire training staff was replaced. I only started about a week before you did, so this is all from what I could get out of other employees.">>\

''You sip at your coffee.''

<<nm $player "Okay… So, and don't get me wrong you know I love spending time with you, but why call me out here to tell me all this?">>\

<<nm $penny "Well, think about it. The circumstances surrounding these girls' deaths is the exact same now as it was a few years ago. On top of that, I've been thinking about those missing lab supplies. I couldn't for the life of me figure out why someone would want to take those chemicals.">>\

''$penny.name passes you a small piece of paper with the missing supplies written out on it.''

<<nm $player "What a random list…">>\

<<nm $penny "Right? The only thing that would happen if you were to ingest all those at once is-">>\

<<nm $player "-that your heart would fucking explode.">>\

@@.men;
<<Pro "UnknownF">>Waitress:<hr>
	That your what now!?@@\

''The waitress from earlier is standing over you, holding two plates and a pot of coffee.''

<<nm $player "Oh, I, uh, was just telling my girlfriend here how she'll love what I have planned for our anniversary so much, her heart'll explode. Right, uh, babe?">>\

''$penny.name plays along, though her obvious blush is telling.''

@@.men;
<<Pro "UnknownF">>Waitress:<hr>
	Awwwww. Well, here you go, you two have a great time now.@@\

''She finally walks away.''

<<nm $penny "So anyway, 'honey', I think it's pretty clear. These girls aren't dying from the harsh training, they're straight up being murdered! It's got to be someone within the office staff, trying to make it look like the trainers' fault.">>\

<<nm $player "Okay, so we find out who it is, politely ask them to confess, and everything goes back to normal. Perfect.">>\

''$penny.name smirks.''

<<nm $penny "Don't be a <<if isMale()>>dick<<else>>bitch<</if>>. Among the missing supplies were a few materials needed to make a dose of CMD serum, however, I was able to put this together…">>\

''$penny.name passes you an opaque plastic case with a syringe inside. Attached is a vial of a yellow chemical.''

<<nm $penny "It uses parts from all three serums we've made so far, making the target easily controllable. The components from the CMD-1 and TFM-1 combine to make the person both aware of their actions, but also warps their mind into believing that following your orders is what they actually really want! The problem was that we didn't have enough supplies to really push the command aspect of the serum, so I augmented it with a powerful aphrodisiac. The side effect of that is some pretty major mental degradation, which given the circumstances, should be fine, if not ideal, even.">>\

<<nm $player "So, your serum makes them stupid, compliant, and horny. Basically, it turns them into a-">>\

<<nm $penny "-a bimbo! Yep! I call it BMB-1. We can use this to oust the murderer and make them confess. Depending on who it is, we might even be able to substitute them in to sell to the client!">>\

''You stare at the plastic case for a moment.''

<<nm $player "By 'we' I assume you mean 'me', right?">>\

''$penny.name giggles, answering you with a simple smile.''

<<nm $player "...Fine... Any idea who it could be though?">>\

<<nm $penny "Well, without a clear motive it's hard to say. It has to be someone who's been here for the last few years, and who has the level of access needed to go down to the B1 floor. That narrows it down to $diana.name, $julia.name, $tasha.name and $john.name, and of course Sophie… The training team and security detail have access, too, but from what you've told me I kinda doubt it's them…">>\

''You consider everything $penny.name's told you tonight, rolling the plastic case in your hands.''

<<nm $player "Guess we only have one shot at it, huh? We don't have much time either... Tomorrow, or I guess later today, ugh, I'll give it ‘til the afternoon before making a decision.">>\

<<pic $penny>>\

<<nm "penny-d" "So, how's it been going down there, in the pit? It must be a lot of fun whipping those little sluts into shape, huh?">>\
<<nm "penny-w" "So, I bet you're having a lot fun slutting up all those girls down in the pit, huh?">>\
<<nm "penny-o" "Hehe, I just hope I've been helpful... Oh hey, how's it going in the pit?">>\
<<nm "penny" "So I've been wondering... How's it been down there, in the pit, I mean? It's gotta be kinda wild.">>\

<<btnChoice "Actually, yeah, it's been kind of interesting" "Story-CH2-PennyTalk2-2" "$c=1">>\
<<btnChoice "It's not really something I'd say I've been enjoying..." "Story-CH2-PennyTalk2-2" "$c=2">>\
<<btnDom "Getting those girls in line has been extremely liberating" "Story-CH2-PennyTalk2-2" "$c=3">>\
<<btnSub "H-huh? Actually, it's kinda stressfull, hehe. I-I'm not sure they'd listen to me at all if not for the serums..." "Story-CH2-PennyTalk2-2" "$c=5">>\
<<btnBimbo "Tee-hee! Actually, kinda yeah! Sometimes I wish I could join them, though..." "Story-CH2-PennyTalk2-2" "$c=4">>\


