''As if reading your mind, $julia.name pulls the sheet back, revealing the lifeless body of a young girl. She's covered from head to toe in bruises, lash marks and taser burns, all of which betray the serene expression on her face.''

<<nm $player "This is... I...">>\

<<nm $sophie "I'm surprised you can remain calm at the sight of this, though I suppose your education helps here. $julia.name tells me she died from internal bleeding brought on by the endless beatings this girl endured during her 'training'. I'll be honest with you, <<Mr>> $player.surname, this isn't the first time this has happened in our facility.<br><br>Still, I trust you'll exercise discretion? I'd prefer that news of this doesn't leave the room.">>\

