''You turn to look at $penny.name. She's fidgeting with her hands, staring at the floor, occasionally looking up at you but only for an instant at a time.''

<<nm $player "What's going to happen to her?">>\

''$julia.name covers the girl before giving you a sharp stare.''

<<nm $julia "She will be discarded. A team will be dispatched from corporate to ensure the proper handling and disposal of the body. Ha, I dare say she'll be treated with more respect now than she ever was when she was still alive...">>\

''$sophie.name shoots $julia.name a disapproving glare.''

<<nm $sophie "Additionally, Sales will be informed, and will make new arrangements with the client. At that point, Acquisitions will procure a suitable replacement.<br><br>$player.name, and you too, $penny.name. I want it to be unquestionably clear why it is I brought you onboard, and how important the work you're doing is. This... this shouldn't be happening. It's just such a... waste.<br><br>...If you'll excuse me.">>\

''$sophie.name exits the room, the security detail at the door follows her back to the lift. You and $penny.name exchange glances for a moment before $julia.name finally speaks up.''

<<nm $julia "You two are free to go. I have everything under control here. As Sophie said, it would be preferable if you weren't to share anything from this little meeting with the rest of the staff. Sophie will handle communications with the sales team, so you needn't worry about filling $john.name and $tasha.name in either.">>\

''With that, $julia.name escorts you both to the door, closing it behind you.''

