<<nm $sophie "<<Mr>> $player.surname... It's been some time since we've spoke in this office, hasn't it? Yes, well, I wanted to speak to you about the... logistical side of last week's incident. I hope that by now you're more accustomed to how we operate, so I'll get right to it.<br><br>That girl was scheduled to be sold to our client this week. Naturally, that will no longer be possible. Luckily for us, he agreed to give us until next Friday to supply a replacement. We've already acquired one, however I need to ensure that her training is handled both expediently and correctly. Another delay will not be tolerated, I'm afraid.">>\

