<<nm $sophie "I thought that would be obvious, I did hire you to do a job after all. You will be supporting the trainers throughout the new product's rehabilitation. I want you there to provide the administration of your serums, as well as consultation on how to use them. I've already spoken to the training team and they are to abstain from using excessive violence. I trust you're up to the task?">>\

