:: Story-CH2-SeeBeatenGirl {"position":"850,23225","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_MedicalOffice>>\

''As you arrive at the office, you're surprised to find $sophie.name waiting for you when you exit the lift.''

<<pic $sophie>>\

<<nm $sophie "<<Mr>> $player.surname, please follow me.">>\

''She seems shaken, or maybe just frustrated? Usually she'd greet you with a little more than your name. You follow her, making sure to keep up with her unusually quick pace. It's not long before you realize she's taking you to $julia.name's office.''

<<Thought "Oh no...">>\

''As the door flies open you see the same pale girl from yesterday, covered in burns and bruises, unconscious in a bed. $julia.name is tending to her.''

<<nm $sophie "Please explain to me how this happened, <<Mr>> $player.surname.">>\

''You pause for a moment.''

<<nm $player "How... I don't... The serum worked perfectly, better than expected, in fact. She willingly offered herself to the trainers the entire time, there was no need for... this... At the end of the day she had collapsed from exhaustion. Craig said he'd have the girl sent up here to rest, and that I was free to go. That was the last time I saw her.">>\

''$sophie.name's expression doesn't change as she considers what you just said. Instead, she returns her focus to the young girl, still resting soundly.''

<<nm $sophie "$julia.name, what are you thoughts?">>\

''$julia.name is wiping a rag down the girl's face, cleaning up streaks of dried blood. She stops to address $sophie.name.''

<<nm $julia "Not much to say, really. These wounds are all consistent with every other girl that passes through our building. The bruising and cuts are all from beatings, both by hand as well as with objects. The burn marks are all from cattle prods, and these shallow cuts around her breasts and abdomen all appear to be from a light whip, or cat-o'nine-tails. I can't tell for sure what the damage is internally, but all things considered there's nothing out of the ordinary here.">>\

''$julia.name returns to cleaning the girl's face and neck.''

<<nm $sophie "$player.name, I believe you. Today we will let the girl recover. I will have a word with Mr. Brianson, you know him as Craig, about his methods and what it means to adhere to my requests. Tomorrow, I ask that you administer the serum again, and again sit in on this one's training. When all is said and done, I also ask that you return the girl here, personally. Do we have an understanding?">>\

''$sophie.name's tone is stern, but sympathetic.''

<<nm $player "Y-yes, ma'am. I'll be ready.">>\

<<nm $sophie "Very good. $julia.name, please see that she is rested and recovered in time for tomorrow.">>\

''$julia.name nods, without actually turning to face $sophie.name.

$sophie.name leaves the room. $julia.name turns around to look at you, wearing an expression that asks “Do you need something?” in a snide sort of way. You try to flash an awkward smile, as you quickly exit the room.''

<<SetFlag $player "seeBeatenGirl">>\
