:: Story-CH3-SophieDinner2 {"position":"225,23725","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Steakhouse>>\

''You've become pretty familiar with this area by now, though you still can't get over seeing $sophie.name's eyes light up every time you approach. The SUV gets parked on the far side of the restaurant and the two of you make your way to the front door.

It's only now you realize just how chilly it's getting. It's early October, after all, and nights tend to get particularly cold, especially outside of the city. After what feels like a lifetime stuck in your underground office the brisk air running up your nose is more than welcome.''

<<nm $sophie "$player.sophieName?">>\

<<nm $player "Hm? Oh, sorry, just taking in the weather. Can't believe it's already October.">>\

<<nm $sophie "It's quite nice, isn't it? Pity they don't have outdoor seating arrangements here. Shall we get inside?">>\

''You walk through the front door and are seated after a brief wait. Drinks are brought to your table, orders are placed, and you don't even notice just how routine this has all become for you. A severe expression on $sophie.name's face quickly brings you back to reality.''

<<nm $player "$sophie.name?">>\

<<nm $sophie "...<br><br>As much as I'd like to use tonight to distract myself from recent events, we have to consider the potential implications of what happened here.">>\

<<nm $player "You mean, $julia.name.">>\

''$sophie.name takes a large sip of her wine.''

<<nm $sophie "$julia.name was... a known variable.">>\

<<nm $player "Wait, you mean you knew she'd snap at some point? I heard rumors that this had happened in the past. Was that $julia.name, too?">>\

''She pauses for a moment before sighing heavily.''

<<nm $sophie "We knew there were some unusual circumstances surrounding her initial employment here, though the exact details were kept from me. As for the last wave of incidents, after a thorough investigation there was nothing directly tying $julia.name to them. Of course, things look different in hindsight...">>\

<<nm $player "Okay... So then what, specifically, are you so worried about?">>\

''Your plates arrive. $sophie.name thanks the waiter then immediately refocuses her attention on you.''

<<nm $sophie "When I hired you, my superiors were more than skeptical about my ambitions. Needless to say, you've far surpassed my expectations, but in doing so have attracted the attention of The Company's board members. $lisa.name, who you met the other day, is one of them. She's also my immediate supervisor.">>\

''You swallow a bite of your steak.''

<<nm $player "And what does that mean? For you, and me?">>\

<<nm $sophie "To be honest, I'm not sure, and I despise being unsure of things. At the very least we can expect a greater showing from Company HQ, likely more frequent visits from $lisa.name, but beyond that... All I can say, <<Mr>> $player.surname, is that you should be careful moving forward. That, and when the time comes, I ask you trust in my decisions as someone with your best interests in mind.">>\

''With that, $sophie.name finishes off her glass of wine and finally starts in on her steak. You refill her glass, and the two of you eat in silence. Some time goes by, and some more wine is consumed, until $sophie.name finally breaks the silence.''

<<nm $sophie "Y'know what!? Why're we s'down right now? $player.name? I'mean, fuck, you're doing great! Y'know that? Y-y-you... makin' your potions'n we're making, I mean, it's SO much MONEY! $lisa.firstName, I-I mean, $lisa.name... she's a... she's a bit of a bitch, y'know? But, she's always been good t'me, and... We'll be FINE! Y'know?">>\

<<nm $player "$sophie.name? You gonna be okay?" "Holy shit she's hammered...">>\

''You must have been more lost in thought than you realized, as you only just now notice the second bottle on the table.''

<<nm $sophie "Gonna be okay? I said I was fine di'n' I!? I... Ohhh, Christ... Did I drink all that? You were s'posed to help! Fuck it, I'll be fine... I need to pee...">>\

''And with that, $sophie.name stumbles to the bathroom. When the waitress comes by you order a cup of coffee for when she gets back.''

<<Thought "Well, I have a dose of serum on me tonight, but, should I really try using it with $sophie.name this drunk? I mean, it'll probably be fine...">>\

<span id="dose">\
	@@.btnChoice;<<button "Put the serum in her drink">>
		<<replace "#dose">>\
			''You pour the contents of the vial into $sophie.name's coffee and give it a quick stir. A couple minutes later she returns to the table and sits down.''
			
			<<nm $sophie "I paid the bill... Is this for me?">>\
			
			<<nm $player "Yeah, figured it might, um, help.">>\
			
			<<nm $sophie "...Thanks.">>\
			
			''She mixes in a couple packets of sugar and takes a large sip. There's a satisfied expression on her face as she drinks. After she sets it back down, she begins to shift slightly in her seat. Her eyes begin to glaze over and their color changes slightly...''
			
			<<btnLink "Issue a command" "Sophie-Dose" "$c=0;$c2=1">>
		<</replace>>\
	<</button>>@@
	@@.btnChoice;<<button "Don't spike her drink">>
		<<replace "#dose">>\
			<<Thought "No, I think I'll leave things alone for now...">>\
			
			''You slip the vial back into your pocket and a couple minutes later, $sophie.name returns to the table.''
			
			<<nm $sophie "I paid the bill... Is this for me?">>\
			
			<<nm $player "Yeah, figured it might, um, help.">>\
			
			<<nm $sophie "...Thanks.">>\
			
			''She mixes in a couple packets of sugar and takes a large sip. There's a satisfied expression on her face as she drinks. You can see her relaxing as she takes in the hot beverage, and after a few minutes the two of you gather your belongs and head back outside.''
			
			<<btnLink [[Continue|Steakhouse-Outside]]>>
		<</replace>>\
	<</button>>@@
</span>\


:: Story-CH3-DianaLeave {"position":"350,23725","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Lobby>>\

''You're on your way to the elevator when something catches your attention. Several boxes are piled up outside of $diana.name's office, and you can hear loud noises coming from inside. You decide to go check on her, knocking on her door frame.''

<<nm $player "Hey $diana.name.">>\

<<pic $diana>>\

<<nm $diana "Ah, $player.name. Come to see me off?">>\

<<if flag($diana,"FullStory")>>\
	<<nm $player "Oh, it's that time already? Damn...">>\
	
	<<nm $diana "Aw, sweetie, don't be sad! I have a feeling we'll see each other again. To be honest, I've been curious as to how headquarters has been doing after all the recent shakeups.">>\
<<else>>\
	<<nm $player "Wait, what? You're leaving?">>\
	
	<<nm $diana "Indeed! I've been called back to headquarters for... reassignment. I'm not too worried, and I'm sure that whoever replaces me will be more than adequate. You'll all be just fine!">>\
<</if>>\

''You try to figure out what to say as you watch $diana.name return to her packing. Despite the fact that she doesn't seem worried in the slightest, you can't help but feel an overwhelming sense of dread...''

<<nm $player "Well, I... Is today your last day?">>\

<<nm $diana "Hm? Oh, no. I'll be in the office tomorrow, then heading out to my new location on Saturday.">>\

''She sets a box down.''

<<nm $diana "Anyway, it was great working with you, $player.name. I have no doubt you'll do well here.">>\

''$diana.name leans in and pulls you close.''

<<pic $action "female-kiss-player">>\

<<nm $diana "Eheh, you take care now!">>\

''She goes back to packing, leaving you standing in the hallway. The ding of the elevator snaps you back to reality, and you head back to the surface. Your usual drivers are waiting there to take you home.''

<<AddNote $diana "Today I found $diana.name packing up her office. Apparently, she's been called back to HQ for some kind of new assignment. Hopefully I'll be able to see her again.">>\
<<btnLink "Go home" "Room">>


:: Story-CH3-MeetLauren {"position":"475,23725","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Lobby>>\

''An announcement over the intercom, which up until now you didn't realize was something your office had, calls everyone into the main lobby where $sophie.name and an attractive woman you don't recognize are waiting. She's tall and thin, and carries herself with confidence. She seems a little nervous, though her large smile hides it well.''

<<pic $sophie>>\

<<nm $sophie "Thank you all for coming. As some of you may know, $diana.name has left our office to return to her responsibilities at Company Headquarters. Today, I would like to introduce her replacement...">>\

''The new girl steps forward, clearing her throat.''

<<pic $lauren>>\

<<nm $lauren "H-hello everyone, my name's $lauren.name, it's nice to meet you all. I'm new around here, so I'll be relying on all of you for support! That said, I've been working as a records clerk both for The Company and other organizations for some time, so I'm confident I'll be able to contribute to the work we do here!">>\

''After her introduction, $lauren.name begins shaking hands with those near her while also intermittently chatting with $sophie.name. $tasha.name and $john.name are standing behind them in the hallway with neutral expressions on their faces. Meanwhile, $penny.name and $julia.name begin chatting next to you.''

<<nm $julia "Ooohhhh, she's SEXY! Can't wait to eat that little cunt of hers... She's big, too, maybe she can take charge, hehe! How about you, $penny.name? Bet you can't wait to taste the new girl!">>\

<<nm $penny "$julia.name! Geez... Anyway, I don't know, it's weird not having $diana.name here...">>\

''$penny.name drifts off a little after that. She doesn't seem to be very attentive. Her distraction actually distracts you enough that you didn't even notice $lauren.name had made her way to you!''

<<nm $lauren "Hi, you must be $player.name! I've heard a lot about you!">>\

<<nm $player "H-huh? Oh, haha, yeah, nice to meet you. You've already heard about me? From $sophie.name?">>\

''$lauren.name giggles playfully.''

<<nm $lauren "Yeah, from $sophie.name sure, but your name's already getting around back at HQ. I was there when they dragged $tory.name into the office. I still can't believe it! I'd love to see your lab some time if-">>\

<<nm $penny "NO! I-I mean, um... There was a bit of a chemical incident recently, still hasn't been completely cleaned up. Can't have any untrained individuals in the lab right now.">>\

<<nm $lauren "Oh my!">>\

<<nm $player "Hm? I wasn't awar-">>\

''Your sentence is cut off quickly by $penny.name's elbow now lodged in your ribcage.''

<<nm $player "Y-yep, big spill, real bad, no visitors...">>\

<<nm $lauren "Aw, that's a shame. Another time then. Anyway, I'm gonna go get settled. Come by and visit some time, okay?">>\

''You wave each other off and $lauren.name heads for the records office as the crowd disperses. Meanwhile, you turn to $penny.name as you clutch your side.''

<<nm $player "Gonna tell me what that was about?">>\

<<nm $penny "What what was about? OH! Yeah, totally... later... Anyway, gotta run. See you at the lab!">>\

''With that, $penny.name rushes off.''

<<Thought "It's gonna be one of those weeks, isn't it?">>\

<<set $player.met.lauren to true>>\
<<meet $lauren>>\
<<AddNote $lauren "Today we met $diana.name's replacement, $lauren.name. She seems nice enough, I guess, but everyone's acting a little weird today...">>\
<<btnLink "Continue" "Work">>


