:: Story-CH3-DaytripChris {"position":"850,23850","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Theater>>\

''You respond to $chris.name's text and let him know you'll meet him at the theater in a couple hours. A couple hours later, you both greet each other in front of the building.''

<<pic $npc "chris">>\

<<nm $chris "Hey $player.name!">>\

<<nm $player "What's up $chris.name!">>\

''After a quick, friendly hug, $chris.name pulls out his phone and starts scrolling through some emails.''

<<nm $chris "Hope you don't mind, I went ahead and ordered some tickets for us so we'd get some good seats. Should be... ah, here they are. Get so many emails these days I can't keep track of anything, haha!">>\

<<nm $player "I know the feeling... So what are we seeing then?">>\

<<nm $chris "Ha, I signed us up for that new shark movie. The one with the dude from Crank in it!">>\

''You laugh and roll your eyes.''

<<nm $player "Alright, well since you got the tickets I'll go ahead and grab us some snacks. Large Dr. Pepper?">>\

<<nm $chris "You got it!">>\

''$chris.name heads off to get the tickets scanned while you make your way to the concessions area. It's a pretty long line, but you still manage to grab everything with some time to spare. You meet up with $chris.name in front of your theater and follow him in. You're in one of the newer ones reserved for big movies on their opening weekends. All the seats recline and the audio system is a lot nicer than your usual theater, the screen's bigger, too. Your seats are dead center in the front of the upper section, giving you a perfect view.''

<<nm $chris "Good seats or what?">>\

<<nm $player "Yeah man, oh, here, take your drink...">>\

''The two of you engage in some idle chatter until the movie finally starts. You recline your seat and settle in for the next couple of hours before leaving the theater and heading into the parking lot. You're a little surprised to see that the sun has already started setting.''

<<nm $player "When did it get so late?">>\

''$chris.name shrugs.''

<<nm $chris "Well, The Place should be open now. Wanna grab those drinks?">>\

<<nm $player "Hell yeah!">>\

''You and $chris.name start walking down to the bar.''

