    <<nm $craig "Normally this is where I'd throw switch to send jolts into her snatch and shut her up... but as you can see our accommodations are a bit lackin' at the moment.">>\

    <<nm $player "Yeah, I can see that... But you know, I might have an idea. Bye $lauren.name, it was so nice seeing you again!">>\

    <<nm $lauren "Mmm, I'll miss you. Don't be a stranger now...">>\

    ''You and $craig.name leave the room, exiting the hallway completely before you stop to talk to him.''

    <<nm $player "$penny.name has been working a lot of fun projects down in... up in the lab. Problem is, it's a bunch of, like, really specific projects that would normally be hard to track. $lauren.name being in there, all alone...">>\

    <<nm $craig "Ahhhhh, you wanna pump her full of that crazy shit you and Specs are cookin' upstairs, huh? I mean, I guess if I'm bein' honest I'm pretty much over the whole thing an' I didn't really have any plans for her anyway, so, what the fuck not! Red's all yours!">>\

    ''$craig.name extends his hand expectantly, giving you a hearty shake once you grip it.''

    <<nm $player "C-cool, yeah. I'll let $penny.name and we'll schedule a time to-">>\

    <<nm $craig "Nah, the boys already know you so just swing by whenever ya' want. I'll let them know you'll be going in an' out of the back area so don't even worry about it!">>\

    <<nm $player "Yeah? Sounds good!">>\

    ''You and $craig.name talk a little longer before returning to the elevator and heading back up to the lobby.''

    <<Thought "Well, this could be fun...">>\

    <<set $UnlockPit to true>>\
    <<run createSlave(getSlaveName("female"),"random","female")>>
    <<run createSlave("lauren","lauren","female","red",5,3,0,0,"Adult")>>\
    <<btnLink "Continue..." "Work">>\


:: Story-CH4-LisaArrives {"position":"475,23975","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Lobby>>\

    ''You arrive at the office, preparing to make your way to the common area in desperate need of caffeination, when you suddenly hear Sophie's voice over the office intercom.''

    <<nm $sophie "$player.name, please come see me in my office immediately.">>\

    <<Thought "Great...">>\

    ''Giving up on any hope of enjoying some morning coffee, you turn around and get back on the elevator. It's a slow ride upwards, but soon enough you arrive on the now-familiar administration floor where $sophie.name's office, as well as the executive meeting room, lie. $sophie.name's door is cracked open at the end of the hall...''

    <<btnLink "Enter $sophie.name's office" "Story-CH4-LisaArrives-2">>


:: Story-CH4-LisaArrives-2 {"position":"600,23975","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_SophieOffice>>\

    <<pic $lisa>>\

    <<nm $lisa "Ah, well if it isn't $player.name. It's nice to see you again. Please, take a seat won't you?">>\

    <<nm $player "O-oh, $lisa.name, right? S-sure..." "Holy fuck, this isn't how I expected to be starting my day.">>\

    ''You do as you're told, taking a seat next to $sophie.name who, incidentally, is looking just as nervous as you are right now.''

    <<nm $lisa "Very good! Judging by the look on your face, I'll go ahead and assume that you weren't told I would be stopping by today. That's okay. $sophie.name, would you care to explain the situation?">>\

    ''$sophie.name clears her throat before quickly collecting herself and turning towards you.''

    <<nm $sophie "O-of course. $player.name, I'm not sure if you knew this or not, but $tory.name's official position within The Company was Sales and Acquisitions Executive. She was-">>\

    <<nm $lisa "$tory.name was effectively our head of sales.">>\

    ''$sophie.name meekly sinks into her chair after being cut off by her superior. You've never seen her quite as submissive as you have today, and it has you just a little concerned. $lisa.name continues.''

    <<nm $lisa "Her sudden... departure... has left us with a bit of a hole in upper management. While there haven't been any major issues yet, it's only a matter of time before spreading our resources too thinly at the top levels causes us to overlook something important.">>\

    <<nm $player "Something like sending down a ginger psychopath to manage our books and create an army of empenised sex zombies?">>\

    ''Your boss's hand slams down on the table, causing you to whip around and see $sophie.name on her feet, absolutely flustered.''

    <<nm $sophie "$player.name!! W-watch your mouth around-">>\

    <<pic $lisa>>\

    <<nm $lisa "Hahahahahaha! Oh my, you didn't tell me <<he>> was so feisty, $sophie.name. Mmmm, I like this one. Please, it's quite alright, everyone relax.">>\

    ''You slowly turn back around to face $lisa.name as $sophie.name once again sinks into her chair, somehow appearing smaller and smaller with every passing moment.''

    <<nm $lisa "Yes! It's exactly as you say. $lauren.name is the unfortunate product of a major power struggle currently escalating among the Executives. What's particularly interesting, is that this facility has somehow become something of a battleground.">>\

    <<Thought "I mean, things have been pretty batshit crazy since I came on, so... makes sense I guess?">>\

    <<nm $sophie "$tory.name's little coup back in September, $diana.name getting recalled to HQ and replaced with $lauren.name, and I daresay even the incident with $julia.name, were all plays made by one of the Executives.">>\

    ''$lisa.name nods along quietly with $sophie.name recounting, an amused smile on her face. You're a little surprised to see how different the two women are from each other. From your very brief meeting with $lisa.name in October, you were expecting someone a little more severe.''

    <<nm $player "Hey, um, something's been bothering me about, well, I guess all of this?">>\

    ''$lisa.name perks up excitedly.''

    <<nm $lisa "Is that a fact? Excellent! You know, only smart <<boy>>s actually think to ask questions. Please, what's on your mind?">>\

    ''You swallow hard, suddenly feeling like you've been put on the spot.''

    <<nm $player "W-well, u-um... Excuse me. So I mean, regardless of what it is The Company deals in, it's still a business, right? When you boil it down it's ran and operated like any other business in the world. Hell, I bet there's even an HR department somewhere.">>\

    ''$lisa.name maintains her smile, happily nodding along in agreement.''

    <<nm $player "Well, the way you're talking right now makes it seem like there's no centralized management or something. Like, in a normal organization this kind of sneaking around and ‘vying for power' or whatever would never be allowed to happen. I know there's a CEO in charge, so... If they wanted employees moved around, or branch offices decommissioned or resources redirected, then that's what would happen, right? I'm just having a hard time understanding how a business can operate this way.">>\

    ''$sophie.name is giving you a surprisingly impressed look, something that you can't help but interpret as "Oh, so you're not as dumb as you look". You're not quite sure how you feel about that. $lisa.name finally takes on a slightly more serious expression, though only just slightly.''

    <<nm $lisa "Mmm, not bad, <<Formal>>, not bad, but I think you're grossly undervaluing just how abnormal this business really is. Or rather, perhaps you don't quite understand how the management hierarchy works within The Company. $sophie.name, let's see how well you've been paying attention! Please, try to explain it to your protege won't you?">>\

    <<pic $sophie>>\

    <<nm $sophie "Y-yes, thank you. Well, it's really not too complicated, honestly, it's just not what one would consider ‘normal' when compared to other, successful businesses. The CEO does in fact have final say when it comes to any projects being approved. Any major funding requests that fall out of a division's budget must be approved by the CEO as well. Ultimately, they steer the ship in their desired direction.">>\

    ''She pauses for a moment, considering how best to move forward.''

    <<nm $lisa "Oh I do love a good nautical metaphor!">>\

    <<nm $sophie "A-anyway, the thing is, it's an extremely large ship, such that the Board of Executives was formed to operate various aspects of The Company with nearly complete autonomy. Sometimes, this means different divisions will achieve some level of overlap with each other. For example, $lisa.name acts as the current Infrastructure and Logistics Executive, however that hasn't stopped us from establishing a small R&D office without this branch. Approval for that had to come from the CEO, and of course approval to seek approval had to come from $lisa.name.">>\

    <<nm $player "I'm guessing that departments within the major divisions have a similar level of autonomy as the primary divisions themselves then.">>\

    ''$lisa.name's smile grows just a little wider.''

    <<nm $lisa "Oh $sophie.name, I'm so happy you found a smart one. Yes, $player.name, that's quite right. Ultimately, the CEO has final say in anything that would have a major impact on The Company as a whole, while the Executives hold that same position over their respective divisions. That said, it would be quite troublesome to involve our esteemed CEO in every little quarrel, so... If one division has something that another one wants...">>\

    <<nm $player "It's on those departments and divisions to achieve their goals however they see fit, so long as it doesn't negatively impact the entire organization. Is that about right?">>\

    <<nm $lisa "However they see fit, you've got it.">>\

    ''The room goes quiet as everyone starts to process the implications of what's just been discussed. Finally, you decide to speak up.''

    <<nm $player "I think that explains a lot... Thank you. So is that why you're here? Making you next move, or...">>\

    <<nm $lisa "In a way, I suppose. Like I said earlier, $tory.name's incident left a hole in upper management, a hole I've been so graciously voluntold to fill. This has pulled my attention away from my favorite manager and her new pet, but since I'm effectively the interim sales exec now it gives me a pretty compelling reason to visit more often.">>\

    <<nm $sophie "That reminds me, our meeting with $john.name and $tasha.name is coming up very soon.">>\

    ''$lisa.name checks her watch, a little shocked at home much time has gone by.''

    <<nm $lisa "Well, I'm glad we finally had the chance to really sit down and talk, <<Formal>>. You should expect to see me around much more often from now on, in fact, I should have an office set up soon enough. I think that's all I have for you. $sophie.name?">>\

    <<nm $sophie "No, I don't have anything else for this meeting. $player.name, you and I will catch up later so I can explain $lisa.name's role in our usual day to day.">>\

    ''The three of you all stand up from the table as $sophie.name moves to open the door.''

    <<nm $player "Thank you. Nice to meet you, $lisa.name.">>\

    <<nm $lisa "And you, $player.name.">>\

    ''You take your leave, quickly making your way back to the elevator.''

    <<Thought "Why do I get the feeling things are about to get a lot crazier around here than they already are...">>\

    <<AddWorkEvent 34>>\
    <<btnLink "Continue" "Work" "passTime()">>


:: Story-CH4-SophieDinner1 {"position":"725,23975","size":"100,100"}
<<pic $sophie>>\

    <<nm $sophie "Ah, $player.sophieName, there you are.">>\

    <<nm $player "Here I am! Heya $sophie.name.">>\

    ''She gives you an unexpectedly warm smile.''

    <<nm $sophie "$player.name... You really are a carefree one, aren't you? I wish I could be so relaxed... I know, how about a night out? My treat!">>\

    ''$sophie.name walks up to you quickly, an almost playful glint in her eye.''

<span id="sophieDinner">\
	@@.btnChoice;<<button "Go out to dinner with $sophie.name">>
		<<replace "#sophieDinner">>\
			''You smile.''
			
			<<nm $player "I mean, I'd be crazy to turn down that offer, right?">>\
			
			<<nm $sophie "Ha, indeed. Well then?">>\
			
			<<btnLink [[Continue|Story-CH4-SophieDinner2]]>>
		<</replace>>\
	<</button>>@@
	@@.btnChoice;<<button "Go home">>
		<<replace "#sophieDinner">>\
			''You smile.''
			
			<<nm $player "Sorry, $sophie.name. I think I need to be getting home tonight. Thanks for the offer, though.">>\
			
			''$sophie.name looks disappointed.''
			
			<<nm $sophie "I understand... Well, I'm sure I'll find some way to relax at home. A good book perhaps...">>\
			
			<<btnLink [[Continue|Home]]>>
		<</replace>>\
	<</button>>@@
</span>\


:: Story-CH4-SophieDinner2 {"position":"850,23975","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Steakhouse>>\

    ''You and $sophie.name arrive at the usual place. Despite this becoming a more regular occurrence, you still can't help but smile at $sophie.name's excitement whenever you come here with her. There's a harsh chill in the November air, and you're more than a little surprised when $sophie.name wraps her arm around yours.''

    <<nm $player "Hm? $sophie.name?">>\

    <<nm $sophie "I'm cold, and as my date it's your to job see to my comfort, no? Come on, let's get warm inside.">>\

    ''You walk through the front door and are seated after a brief wait. Drinks are brought to your table, orders are placed, and the two of you ease into your seats. You can tell $sophie.name's anxious about something, though she's exuding less intensity than usual.''

    <<nm $player "$sophie.name? Everything okay?">>\

    <<nm $sophie "Hm? Oh, haha, yes... sorry, just a little lost in thought. I'm always a little on edge whenever $lisa.name decides to drop in.">>\

    <<nm $player "Not the first time she's done this?">>\

    ''$sophie.name takes a large sip of her wine.''

    <<pic $sophie>>\

    <<nm $sophie "Hmph, no it isn't. Every so often she'll decide her presence is 'required' for a week or so. Sometimes we're struggling with a particular project, sometimes it's just because she wants some time away from HQ. Either way, it's extra stress that I'm not particularly excited to be taking on.">>\

    <<nm $player "Sure, I get that... Hard to do your job when you boss is breathing down your neck.">>\

    ''She blushes while finishing off her glass.''

    <<nm $sophie "Indeed, and in $lisa.name's case that can be taking quite literally...">>\

    <<nm $player "W-wait, you mean you and $lisa.name-">>\

    ''Your plates arrive, giving $sophie.name an easy escape from your question as she stuffs her mouth with a large bite of still steaming steak. You shrug and start in on your plate as well. The two of you quietly enjoy your meals together for some time before $sophie.name finally breaks the silence.''

    <<nm $sophie "In any case, I'm not at all surprised to see her here now... not after everything that $lauren.name tried to pull and the chaos she brought with her.">>\

    ''You swallow a bite of your steak.''

    <<nm $player "Yeah, $lauren.name was... something special...">>\

    <<nm $sophie "That's certainly one way to put it. Whatever fate awaits that slut down in the pit is certainly too good for her!">>\

    ''$sophie.name aggressively finishes off her second glass of wine before refilling it and moving on to what's left of her meal. Conversation is minimal, but you can her constantly muttering under her breath as she eats. Before you know it, she's polishing off her fifth glass as the last bits of food on her plate disappear.''

    <<nm $sophie "Uuggghhhh... Heeeyyyyy... $player.name?">>\

    <<nm $player "Hm? Yeah, what's up?" "And she's drunk again...">>\

    ''She rests her nose on her folded hands, giving you a long look before raising her head.''

    <<if $sophie.dose > 0>>\
        <<nm $sophie "You're gonna come home w'th me tonight. Case closed.">>\

        ''You nearly spit out your drink.''

        <<nm $player "S-sorry, what was that!?">>\

        <<nm $sophie "Mmmmmmhm! C'mon, le's get in the car. That's on order!">>\

        ''$sophie.name stands up and grabs you by the hand, pulling you to your feet as she stumbles out of the restaurant. You can never quite catch your breath enough to argue with her, and before you know it you've been pulled into her now-moving SUV.''

        <<nm $player "H-hey, hold oMPH-">>\

        <<pic $sophie "kiss-player">>\

        <<nm $sophie "Mmmm, mmmmm... Shhh, we can talk later baby, mmmmm...">>\

        ''And with that, you're off to gods know where making out with your boss in the back of a company vehicle...''

        <<btnLink "Continue..." "Sophie-Apartment-Intro" "setTime('night')">>\
    <<else>>\
        <<nm $sophie "I... Am gonna go... pee...">>\

        ''And with that, $sophie.name stumbles to the bathroom. When the waitress comes by you order a cup of coffee for when she gets back.''

        <<Thought "Well, I have a dose of serum on me tonight, but, should I really try using it with $sophie.name this drunk? I mean, it'll probably be fine...">>\

        <span id="dose">\
            @@.btnChoice;<<button "Put the serum in her drink">>
                <<replace "#dose">>\
                    ''You pour the contents of the vial into $sophie.name's coffee and give it a quick stir. A couple minutes later she returns to the table and sits down.''
                    
                    <<nm $sophie "I paid the bill... Is this for me?">>\
                    
                    <<nm $player "Yeah, figured it might, um, help.">>\
                    
                    <<nm $sophie "...Thanks.">>\
                    
                    ''She mixes in a couple packets of sugar and takes a large sip. There's a satisfied expression on her face as she drinks. After she sets it back down, she begins to shift slightly in her seat. Her eyes begin to glaze over and their color changes slightly...''
                    
                    <<btnLink "Issue a command" "Sophie-Dose" "$c=0;$c2=1">>
                <</replace>>\
            <</button>>@@
            @@.btnChoice;<<button "Don't spike her drink">>
                <<replace "#dose">>\
                    <<Thought "No, I think I'll leave things alone for now...">>\
                    
                    ''You slip the vial back into your pocket and a couple minutes later, $sophie.name returns to the table.''
                    
                    <<nm $sophie "I paid the bill... Is this for me?">>\
                    
                    <<nm $player "Yeah, figured it might, um, help.">>\
                    
                    <<nm $sophie "...Thanks.">>\
                    
                    ''She mixes in a couple packets of sugar and takes a large sip. There's a satisfied expression on her face as she drinks. You can see her relaxing as she takes in the hot beverage, and after a few minutes the two of you gather your belongs and head back outside.''
                    
                    <<btnLink [[Continue|Steakhouse-Outside]]>>
                <</replace>>\
            <</button>>@@
        </span>\
    <</if>>\


:: Story-CH4-CheckOnDiana {"position":"975,23975","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Lobby>>\

    ''You arrive at the office and grab a fresh cup of coffee from the commons area. As you return to the elevator, you notice $diana.name's door is open enough that you catch a glimpse of her behind her desk. You can't help but notice that she's staring off into space, a listless expression in her eyes, and she's panting heavily.''

    <<Thought "$diana.name?">>\

    ''You knock on the doorframe.''

    <<pic $diana>>\

    <<nm $diana "H-huh? What? $player.name? When did you get here.">>\

    <<nm $player "Just got here, you're looking really out of it, though. Everything okay?">>\

    ''She fidgets a little as she props herself back up in her chair, now sitting up straight again.''

    <<nm $diana "Yes $player.name, everything's okay. I'm just not much of a morning person these days, haha!">>\

    <<Thought "Hmm...">>\

    <<nm $player "You sure you're okay? You've been acting a little strange ever since I saw you at Company HQ.">>\

    <<nm $diana "I-I... $player.name, I've got a lot of work I need to get to. I've been gone for nearly a month and my predecessor didn't do a damn thing in my stead. I assure you I'm quite alright.">>\

	<<AddWorkEvent 36>>\
	<<AddWorkEvent 37>>\
    <<btnChoice "Press her about what's going on" "Story-CH4-CheckOnDiana-Press">>
    <<btnChoice "Back off and accept what she says" "Story-CH4-CheckOnDiana-Pass">>


:: Story-CH4-CheckOnDiana-Press {"position":"1100,23975","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_RecordsOffice>>\

    ''You decide to close the door behind you and see if you can get $diana.name to open up.''

    <<nm $player "Come on $diana.name, I noticed you acting differently back when I saw you at the HQ building... What's going on?">>\

    ''She bites her bottom lip as she thinks for a moment before finally asking you to take a seat in front of her.''

    <<pic $diana>>\

    <<nm $diana "$james.name did something to me, and if he took you on that little tour he's so proud of, I'm betting you have a pretty good idea of what it was.">>\

    <<nm $player "$diana.name...">>\

    ''$diana.name leans back in her chair, reaches into her desk drawer and pulls out a small pouch. It looks like a blood bag, only the contents appear to have a milky color.''

    <<nm $diana "Synthetic semen, or so they say... It's fun, if I don't swallow my fill of delicious jizz every few hours, it starts to feel like my blood sugar is crashing. What's worse is that the 'hungrier' I get, the more uncontrollably aroused I become. I suppose it's a way of ensuring I'll do whatever I need to in order to feed myself. Hahaha, it's like I've become some kind of cum vampire!">>\

    ''She lets out an amused, self-deprecating laugh, before ripping off the bag's seal and drinking down the fluid.''

    <<nm $player "I'm sorry $diana.name, that's awful.">>\

    <<nm $diana "Mmmm, excuse me... Awful? I'm quite sure the intent was that this would give $james.name some measure of control over me, limiting my supply and all. I guess they didn't account for just how willing I was to drink from the tap, so to speak, hahaha!">>\

    <<nm $player "Well... I'm glad you're at least having a good attitude... I guess. Just let me know if there's anything I can do to help, okay?">>\

    <<if hasPenis()>>\
        ''$diana.name stares intently at your crotch as you stand up, licking her lips.''

        <<nm $diana "I certainly will, <<Formal>>...">>\
    <<else>>\
        ''$diana.name smiles warmly at you.''

        <<nm $diana "I appreciate, $player.name.">>\
    <</if>>\

    ''With that, you leave $diana.name to her 'meal' and leave the office.''

    <<love $diana>>
    <<lust $diana>>

    <<horny 10>>

    <<AddNote $diana "I talked to $diana.name today. It seems that $james.name altered her body while she was at Company HQ, forcing her to consume synthetic semen to stay alive...">>\
    <<btnLink "Continue" "Work">>


:: Story-CH4-CheckOnDiana-Pass {"position":"1225,23975","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_RecordsOffice>>\

    ''You lean back, stepping towards the door as you give $diana.name a reassuring smile.''

    <<nm $player "Well... okay then. If you ever want to talk, though...">>\

    <<pic $diana>>\

    <<nm $diana "Of course, $player.name. I do appreciate your concern. Now, if you'll excuse me...">>\

    ''You leave $diana.name's office, closing the door behind you.''


    <<AddNote $diana "I noticed $diana.name acting a little strange today... I tried to talk to her but she insisted she was fine. Hopefully there's nothing too serious going on with her...">>\
    <<btnLink "Continue" "Work">>


:: Story-CH4-FamilyBreakfast {"position":"100,24100","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Kitchen>>\

    ''You yawn loudly as you walk into the kitchen, eliciting a bright 'Morning!' from your <<mother>>. After pouring some coffee, you take a seat at the table while $mom.realName puts a plate together for you before sitting down herself.''

    <<pic $mom>>\

    <<nm $mom "Haha, I was hoping the smell of bacon would get you down here before work. I wanted to talk to you about Thanksgiving!">>\

    <<nm $player "Thanksgiving? I didn't think we ever did anything for Thanksgiving, what's up?">>\

    ''$mom.realName washes down a mouthful of food with a drink of coffee.''

    <<nm $mom "Well, it seems your cousin will be spending the holiday with us, so I thought it'd be fun to go a little crazy this year!">>\

    <<nm $player "Oh, okay... Wait, what cousin?">>\

    ''Your <<mother>> starts to respond, but then quickly stops as she seems to work something out in her head. Finally, she focuses her attention back on you.''

    <<nm $mom "You remember your aunt Lily, right? My sister?">>\

    <<nm $player "Mhm... Oh, so, it's $elsa.name, right?">>\

    <<nm $mom "Oh you do remember! You and your <<sister>> spent a summer out there when you were kids, I wasn't sure if you remembered $elsa.name or not.">>\

    ''She takes a minute to eat some more food and take another sip of coffee.''

    <<nm $player "So she's spending the holiday with us?">>\

    <<nm $mom "Yup! She'll be arriving next Monday. I'm gonna go all out this year!">>\
    
    ''You shrug and quickly finish your breakfast.''

    <<nm $player "Sounds good! Anyway, I'm gonna be late for work. See you later, $mom.name!">>\

    ''You leave your plate and coffee mug in the sink and run out the door.''

    <<btnLink "Go to work" "GotoWork">>\


:: Story-CH4-LisaAndSophie {"position":"225,24100","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Lobby>>\

    ''Walking into the office, you happen to catch $sophie.name and $lisa.name having a whispered conversation in a dark room. With a sense of self-preservation, you quietly put your ear to the door.''

    <<pic $sophie>>\

    <<nm $sophie "I'm not stupid, $lisa.name! I know exactly was that piece of shit is trying to do!">>\

    <<nm $lisa "I know you know, and keep your voice down! Don't forget, I'm still an exec, and your supervisor...">>\

    ''The women both take a minute to calm down.''

    <<nm $sophie "Sorry, I just... Ever since my proposal was chosen it's been nonstop, and now he's starting to play some seriously dangerous games. I mean, you DO know what he did to Diana, don't you?">>\

    <<pic $lisa>>\

    <<nm $lisa "Yes, of course I know! I was one of the approvals on that experiment.">>\

    <<nm $sophie "You... I... I suppose you would have been... But still...">>\

    <<nm $lisa "We'll get through this and we'll deal with him in the process, it's why I'm down here, after all. In the mean time, just keep it together, okay?">>\

    ''$lisa.name strokes $sophie.name's chin, eliciting an out-of-character purr from the woman.''

    <<nm $lisa "Can you do that for me?">>\

    ''$sophie.name's voice drops to barely a whisper.''

    <<nm $sophie "Y-yes...">>\

    ''You quietly step away, not wanting to get caught snooping by those two of all people.''

    <<btnLink "Continue" "Work">>\


:: Story-CH4-DaytripChris {"position":"350,24100","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Park>>\

    ''$chris.name is already waiting for you up ahead as you approach the agreed upon meeting point.''

    <<pic $npc "chris">>\

    <<nm $chris "What up! Ready to get your ass kicked?">>\

    ''You stop short.''

    <<nm $player "I, um, didn't think that's what I agreed to today? I mean, I'm not ruling it out, you did text me pretty early...">>\

    ''$chris.name doubles over laughing before pointing behind him with his thumb. Over his should you can clearly see a bowling alley.''

    <<nm $player "Oh... OH! Sure, what the hell...">>\

    <<nm $chris "Hahaha, oh man... Yeah it's been a while since I've gone out for this, plus I hear the bar here opens at noon, so, hey!">>\

    <<if $chris.canRomance>>\
        ''You casually walk up to $chris.name and link your elbow with his, laughing together as he escorts you to the building.''
    <<else>>\
