:: Story-CH4-SophieDate1 {"position":"850,24975","size":"100,100"}
<<pic $sophie>>\

    <<nm $sophie "Ah, $player.sophieName, there you are. Care to grab a bite to eat?">>\

    ''$sophie.name smiles at you while waiting for your answer. You can tell she's a little anxious tonight.''

    <span id="sophieDinner">\
        @@.btnChoice;<<button "Go out to dinner with $sophie.name">>
            <<replace "#sophieDinner">>\
                ''You smile.''
                
                <<nm $player "I mean, I'd be crazy to turn down that offer, right?">>\
                
                <<nm $sophie "Ha, indeed. Well then?">>\
                
                <<btnLink "Continue" "Story-CH4-SophieDate2">>
            <</replace>>\
        <</button>>@@
        @@.btnChoice;<<button "Go home">>
            <<replace "#sophieDinner">>\
                ''You smile.''
                
                <<nm $player "Sorry, $sophie.name. I think I need to be getting home tonight. Thanks for the offer, though.">>\
                
                ''$sophie.name looks disappointed.''
                
                <<nm $sophie "I understand... Well, I'm sure I'll find some way to relax at home. A good book perhaps...">>\
                
                <<btnLink "Continue" "Home">>
            <</replace>>\
        <</button>>@@
    </span>\


:: Story-CH4-SophieDate2 {"position":"975,24975","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Steakhouse>>\

    ''You and $sophie.name arrive at the usual place. Despite this becoming a more regular occurrence, you still can't help but smile at $sophie.name's excitement whenever you come here with her. The December air is cold, and the wind cuts through your coat. $sophie.name holds you close.''

    <<nm $player "Hm? $sophie.name?">>\

    <<nm $sophie "When we're out at night it's your job to keep me warm!">>\

    <<nm $player "S-sorry, right...">>\

    ''You walk through the front door and are seated after a brief wait. Drinks are brought to your table, orders are placed, and the two of you ease into your seats.''

    <<nm $player "Well, this is nice!">>\

    <<nm $sophie "Mmm, yes, I really needed the break.">>\

    <<nm $player "Something up? I mean, besides all the obvious craziness...">>\

    ''$sophie.name takes a large sip of her wine.''

    <<pic $sophie>>\

    <<nm $sophie "Isn't the obvious craziness enough? Do you need more!?">>\

    <<nm $player "Haha, well, no... Just making sure you're alright.">>\

    ''She blushes while finishing off her glass.''

    <<nm $sophie "I'm fine... $lisa.name in town is stressful enough, but $erik.name showing up just takes it to a whole other level...">>\

    <<nm $player "That guy...">>\

    ''Your plates arrive, breaking the tension at least a little. $sophie.name begins cutting her steak.''

    <<nm $sophie "You were going to say he creeps you out, right?">>\

    ''You swallow a bite of your steak.''

    <<nm $player "I-I, um...">>\

    <<nm $sophie "That would be the correct reaction, I think. Frankly the man makes my skin crawl.">>\

    ''$sophie.name aggressively finishes off her second glass of wine before refilling it and moving on to what's left of her meal. Conversation is minimal, but you can her constantly muttering under her breath as she eats. Before you know it, she's polishing off her fifth glass as the last bits of food on her plate disappear.''

    <<nm $sophie "Uuggghhhh... Heeeyyyyy... $player.name?">>\

    <<nm $player "Hm? Yeah, what's up?" "And she's drunk again...">>\

    ''She rests her nose on her folded hands, giving you a long look before raising her head.''

    <<if $sophie.dose > 0 and not visited("Sophie-Apartment-Intro")>>\
        <<nm $sophie "You're gonna come home w'th me tonight. Case closed.">>\

        ''You nearly spit out your drink.''

        <<nm $player "S-sorry, what was that!?">>\

        <<nm $sophie "Mmmmmmhm! C'mon, le's get in the car. That's on order!">>\

        ''$sophie.name stands up and grabs you by the hand, pulling you to your feet as she stumbles out of the restaurant. You can never quite catch your breath enough to argue with her, and before you know it you've been pulled into her now-moving SUV.''

        <<nm $player "H-hey, hold oMPH-">>\

        <<pic $sophie "kiss-player">>\

        <<nm $sophie "Mmmm, mmmmm... Shhh, we can talk later baby, mmmmm...">>\

        ''And with that, you're off to gods know where making out with your boss in the back of a company vehicle...''

        <<btnLink "Continue..." "Sophie-Apartment-Intro" "setTime('night')">>\
    <<else>>\
        <<nm $sophie "I... Am gonna go... pee...">>\

        ''And with that, $sophie.name stumbles to the bathroom. When the waitress comes by you order a cup of coffee for when she gets back.''

        <<Thought "Well, I have a dose of serum on me tonight, but, should I really try using it with $sophie.name this drunk? I mean, it'll probably be fine...">>\

        <span id="dose">\
            @@.btnChoice;<<button "Put the serum in her drink">>
                <<replace "#dose">>\
                    ''You pour the contents of the vial into $sophie.name's coffee and give it a quick stir. A couple minutes later she returns to the table and sits down.''
                    
                    <<nm $sophie "I paid the bill... Is this for me?">>\
                    
                    <<nm $player "Yeah, figured it might, um, help.">>\
                    
                    <<nm $sophie "...Thanks.">>\
                    
                    ''She mixes in a couple packets of sugar and takes a large sip. There's a satisfied expression on her face as she drinks. After she sets it back down, she begins to shift slightly in her seat. Her eyes begin to glaze over and their color changes slightly...''
                    
                    <<btnLink "Issue a command" "Sophie-Dose" "$c=0;$c2=1">>
                <</replace>>\
            <</button>>@@
            @@.btnChoice;<<button "Don't spike her drink">>
                <<replace "#dose">>\
                    <<Thought "No, I think I'll leave things alone for now...">>\
                    
                    ''You slip the vial back into your pocket and a couple minutes later, $sophie.name returns to the table.''
                    
                    <<nm $sophie "I paid the bill... Is this for me?">>\
                    
                    <<nm $player "Yeah, figured it might, um, help.">>\
                    
                    <<nm $sophie "...Thanks.">>\
                    
                    ''She mixes in a couple packets of sugar and takes a large sip. There's a satisfied expression on her face as she drinks. You can see her relaxing as she takes in the hot beverage, and after a few minutes the two of you gather your belongs and head back outside.''
                    
                    <<btnLink [[Continue|Steakhouse-Outside]]>>
                <</replace>>\
            <</button>>@@
        </span>\
    <</if>>\


:: Story-CH4-LisaMission {"position":"1100,24975","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Lobby>>\

    ''As you exit the elevator, you're more than a little surprised to see $lisa.name and $penny.name standing in the middle of the lobby, seemingly waiting for you.''

    <<pic $penny>>\

    <<nm $penny "$player.name! Good morning!">>\

    <<nm $lisa "Ah, there you are. Come on you two, we're going to have a little chat upstairs!">>\

    <<nm $player "I, um... Good morning?">>\

    ''You step to the side, allowing $penny.name and $lisa.name to board the elevator first before following them inside. $lisa.name presses the button for the executive floor, and a few moments later the three of you find yourselves in an empty conference room.''

    <<pic $lisa>>\

    <<nm $lisa "$penny.name, if you wouldn't mind closing the door. Now then, I wanted to talk about what happened to $tory.name a few months ago.">>\

    <<nm $player "R-right, about that...">>\

    ''$lisa.name starts laughing.''

    <<nm $lisa "No, no... No need to apologize, frankly I thought it was brilliant. Actually, what I wanted to talk to about was the how of it all. I understand the serum used on $tory.name was developed by you two in the lab?">>\

    <<pic $penny>>\

    <<nm $penny "Yep! $player.name worked on that one. We call it our $serum[4].name serum.">>\

    <<if $story.makeCMD1>>\
        <<nm $player "Yep, we were able to get that made just in time for the meeting.">>\
    <<else>>\
        <<nm $player "Yeah, actually we wouldn't have been able to pull that off without $penny.name coming in clutch.">>\

        <<nm $penny "Hehe, I try!">>\
    <</if>>\

    ''You and $penny.name recount the event from your perspective while $lisa.name listens intently.''

    <<nm $lisa "Okay, so let me ask you something. Have you two continued development on the $serum[4].name serum since then?">>\

    <<nm $player "Not exactly, we were pretty happy with the effect at that point.">>\

    <<nm $lisa "I see... Okay, do you think it would be possible to create a version of this particular serum, specifically allowing for direct control over the person, but without the intense change to libido and with more mental autonomy?">>\

    ''You and $penny.name sit back in your chairs and exchange some brief glances. $penny.name is the first to speak.''

    <<nm $penny "So you mean, like... Hold on, um...">>\

    <<nm $player "Sounds like you're basically wanting to be able to make sleeper agents or something...">>\

    <<nm $penny "Yeah, that's it! Haha, wow, this is some Tom Clancy bullshit. But I mean, it shouldn't be 'that' hard, right $player.name?">>\

    ''You look over at $lisa.name.''

    <<nm $player "Is this request coming from $james.name? Sounds like him.">>\

    <<nm $lisa "Hmph, no it most certainly is not coming from that man. No, this is a personal project of mine, and I'd like to keep the people who know about it as small as possible, ideally just us three.">>\

    ''$penny.name looks at you and shrugs.''

    <<nm $penny "The biggest problem right now is the supply chain. For what I think we'll need to get this working, I'm thinking... probably around the first of the year for something usable.">>\

    <<nm $player "That's about what I was thinking.">>\

    ''$lisa.name thinks for a moment.''

    <<pic $lisa>>\

    <<nm $lisa "That'll work, if you can get it to me before the end of January I think that'll be just fine. I'll be waiting!">>\

    ''$lisa.name stands and quickly heads for the door, bringing an abrupt end to your small meeting. You and $penny.name quickly stand and follow her out the door and into the elevator while she waits behind for $sophie.name.''

    <<nm $penny "Hey boss, this feels kinda crazy, yeah?">>\

    <<nm $player "Does it? There's been so much crazy lately that I almost didn't notice.">>\

    <<nm $penny "Good point! Haha, ha... hm...">>\

    ''The two of you head quietly back to the lab.''

    <<SetFlag $player "LisaMission">>\
    <<btnLink "Continue" "Work" "setTime('lm')">>


:: Story-CH4-ChristmasPlans {"position":"1225,24975","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Kitchen>>\

    ''You walk into the kitchen to find your <<mom>> sitting at the table sipping coffee and picking at a large plate of bacon.''

    <<pic $mom>>\

    <<nm $mom "Oh, hey hun. This was about to go bad, so, big plate of bacon!">>\

    <<nm $player "I can't think of a better thing to wake up to.">>\

    ''You pour a cup of coffee and sit down with your <<mother>>, helping her work her way through the mountain of crispy bacon.''

    <<nm $mom "Hey, so Christmas is right around the corner. We don't really have any plans this year, but I thought I'd cook a big dinner for Christmas Eve. Was there anyone you wanted to invite? <<if isMale()>>A girlfriend? Boyfriend maybe?<<else>>A boyfriend? Girlfriend maybe?<</if>>">>\

    <<nm $player "A whole day in the kitchen last month wasn't enough? Well, if that's the case...">>\

    ''You think for a moment while eating another strip.''

    <<if $penny.isDating>>\
        <<btnChoice "Bring $penny.name over for dinner" "ChristmasPlans-Penny">>\
