:: Story-CH4-ChristmasDinner-chris {"position":"850,25100","size":"100,100"}
<<set $CanTF to false, $player.wakeup to "christmas">>\
    <<loc_Kitchen>>\

    ''Just as your <<mother>> starts putting together serveware for the roast she's been working on all day, the doorbell rings. You run over to answer it.''

    <<pic $chris>>\

    <<nm $player "$chris.name!">>\

    <<nm $chris "Hey hey! Merry Christmas, $player.name!">>\

    ''$chris.name stands at the door with his arms open wide, holding a large bottle of wine in one hand, before pulling you in for a big hug. You take his coat and get him inside.''

    <<nm $chris "I know your <<mom>> likes wine so I figured she wouldn't mind if I brought her some. Speakin' of, what's that smell!?">>\

    <<nm $player "Ah, $mom.name's been working on a roast all day and it smells like it just came out of the oven.">>\

    <<nm $chris "Awesome! Guess I showed up just in time!">>\

    <<pic $mom>>\

    <<nm $mom "You certainly did! Hi $chris.name, it's been way too long!">>\

    <<nm $chris "Yeah Ms. $player.surname, way too long!">>\

    ''Your <<mother>> and $chris.name exchange hugs.''

    <<pic $sister>>\

    <<nm $sister "Heya $chris.name, remember me?">>\

    <<nm $chris "Hell yeah I do! Bring it in baby!">>\

    ''$chris.name pulls $sister.name in for a tight hug which she more than happily returns.''  

    <<nm $mom "Well, shall we take this conversation to the kitchen table? Dinner's all ready to go!">>\

    ''The four of you all migrate to the kitchen. The table is covered in side dishes, potatoes, gravy, breads, veggies, and in the center is a huge steaming roast, pulled apart and resting in a large glass tray.''

    <<nm $mom "Alright everyone, sit down and serve up. We're eating good tonight!">>\

    ''You all spend the next hour or so enjoying way too much good food, laughing, drinking, and generally enjoying each others' company. $chris.name is clearly having a great time getting to know your <<mother>> and <<sister>>, while occassionally playfully nudging you with his elbow and giving you a wide smile every time you look over at him.''

    <<pic $chris>>\

    <<nm $chris "Maaaaaaan, I think I overdid it! Ms. $player.surname, do you need any help cleaning up?">>\

    <<nm $mom "That'd be lovely $chris.name, thank you so much!">>\

    ''$mom.realName and $chris.name both get up and start clearing the table. You stand up to try to help but are quickly shot down.''

    <<nm $player "Well, guess we get to watch...">>\

    <<if $chris.canRomance>>\
        <<nm $sister "You know how $mom.name is, plus she probably just wants some alone time with your new boyfriend.">>\

        <<nm $player "B-boyfriend?">>\

        ''$chris.name, clearly overhearing your <<sister>>, laughs to himself in the kitchen.''
    <<else>>\
        <<nm $sister "You know how $mom.name is, plus she probably missed having $chris.name over just as much as you did.">>\
    <</if>>\

    <<nm $chris "Oh yeah!">>\

    ''You're nearly scared out of your seat when $chris.name somehow appears behind you and yells into your ear.''

    <<nm $chris "Totally forgot I brought that wine! Ready to bust into it?">>\

    ''$chris.name grabs the last of the plates on the table and takes them to your <<mom>> at the sink before getting directed to the bottle opener and wine glasses. He and $mom.realName both return to the table at the same time.''

    <<nm $mom "Mmm, dinner was great, now for some dessert!">>\

    <<nm $chris "Hehe, I like the sound of that Ms. $player.surname!">>\

