    <<nm $tasha "Well, it's probably about time I head home...">>\

    <<nm $mom "Whaaaa? $tasha.name, sweetie, no... It's freezing outside and you've had WAY too much wine. Come on, c'mon, you're staying here with us tonight. $player.name, $tasha.name can sleep with you in your room, you don't mind, do you?">>\

    ''$tasha.name looks at you, blushing wildly.''

    <<nm $player "I mean, couldn't say no if I wanted to. $tasha.name, wanna stay over?">>\

    <<nm $tasha "A-are you sure? Really!? I-I mean if you d-don't mind... Um, $sister.name, do you some... $sister.name?">>\

    ''$sister.name is passed out.''

    <<nm $mom "Yep, she's got the right idea. $player.name, I'mma gonna help your <<sister>> up to the, uh, her rooms. Get $tasha.name situation up in your room and remember to be respectable!">>\

    <<nm $player "$mom.name, your bed, go to drunk.">>\

    <<nm $mom "C'mon $sister.name, stand up, one foot in front of the... there we go...">>\

    ''You watch at the bottom of the stairs, making sure your family makes it upstairs safely.''

    <<nm $player "Alright, ready $tasha.name?">>\

    <<nm $tasha "U-uh huh!!">>\

    ''The two of you head up to your bedroom.''

    <<btnLink "Continue" "ChristmasEve-Tasha" "setTime('night')">>\


:: ChristmasEve-Tasha {"position":"725,25225","size":"100,100"}
