:: Story-CH4-ChristmasMorning {"position":"850,25225","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Kitchen>>\

    ''You walk downstairs to $mom.name and $sister.name waiting for you in the kitchen. A fresh pot of coffee is brewed and muffins are on the table. They're both still in their pajamas and seem to having a pretty good time.''

    <<pic $mom>>\

    <<nm $mom "Merry Christmas baby! Come sit with us!">>\

    <<nm $sister "Mmph. Mmphins!">>\

    <<nm $player "Haha, merry Christmas guys.">>\

    ''You sit and join your family for coffee and muffins, and the three of you take your time enjoying each others' company.''

    <<pic $sister>>\

    <<nm $sister "I'm glad we all agreed not to buy gifts this year. This is a lot nicer.">>\

    <<nm $player "You're only saying that because you forget to buy anyone anything.">>\

    ''$sister.name chokes on her muffin.''

    <<switch $guest>>\
        <<case "penny">>\
            <<nm $mom "Say, where's $penny.name? She's not sticking around for breakfast with us?">>\
        <<case "tasha">>\
            <<nm $mom "Say, where's $tasha.name? She's not sticking around for breakfast with us?">>\
        <<case "sophie">>\
            <<nm $mom "Say, where's $sophie.name? She's not sticking around for breakfast with us?">>\
        <<case "john">>\
            <<nm $mom "Say, where's $john.name? He's not sticking around for breakfast with us?">>\
        <<case "chris">>\
            <<nm $mom "Say, where's $chris.name? He's not sticking around for breakfast with us?">>\
    <</switch>>\

    <<nm $player "They had to leave early, I know work's been really busy. Still left me a nice note and a gift.">>\

    <<nm $mom "That's so sweet! Well, let's enjoy our Christmas together and try to have a nice relaxing day!">>\

    ''Your <<sister>> nods in emphatic agreement and the three of you sit around the table eating muffins and drinking coffee for a good while before finally going your separate ways.''

    <<btnLink "Continue" "Home" "passTime()">>


:: Story-CH4-Betrayal {"position":"975,25225","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_CompanyHQ>>\
    <<nobr>>\
        <<set $traitor={name:"Shrouded Figure",style:"men",id:"traitor",identity:"",portrait:""}>>
        <<if not ($penny.isDating or dose($penny,"obedient"))>>
            <<set $traitor.portrait to "UnknownF", $traitor.identity to "Penny">>
        <<elseif not visited("Story-CH4-CheckOnDiana-Press")>>
            <<set $traitor.portrait to "UnknownF", $traitor.identity to "Diana">>
        <<elseif $john.dose is 0 and $john.isMale>>
            <<set $traitor.portrait to "Unknown", $traitor.identity to "John">>
        <<else>>
            <<set $traitor.portrait to "UnknownF", $traitor.identity to "Julia">>
        <</if>>
        <<set $traitor.isSimple to true>>\
    <</nobr>>\

    ''Meanwhile, in the lower levels of a large office building, tucked away in a large city, three individuals are meeting in secret.''

    <<pic $james>>\

    <<nm $james "See Erik, I told you they'd come through!">>\

    <<nm $erik "Yes James, I suppose you did...">>\

    ''Opposite $james.name and $erik.name, a shrouded figure sits in the darkness.''

    <<nm $james "So, you were able to get everything I asked for?">>\

    <<nm $traitor "Sure did!">>\

    ''The person hands a very small package over to $james.name. He inspects it and smiles.''

    <<nm $james "Beautiful! You've don't an excellent job!">>\

    <<switch $traitor.identity>>\
        <<case "Penny">>\
            <<nm $traitor "Hey, y-you're sure <<he>> won't get hurt? I'm not feeling super cool about all this...">>\

            <<nm $erik "Of course, no one's going to get hurt... At least, no one you know of, hahaha!">>\
        <<case "Diana">>\
            <<nm $traitor "And you promise that once all this is over you'll... you'll fix this?">>\

            <<nm $erik "Of course, we've made all the necessary preparations on our end.">>\
        <<case "John">>\
            <<nm $traitor "Yeah, yeah... Cash is already in the account, 'uh?">>\
            
            <<nm $erik "Yep! Don't spend it all in one place, now!">>\
        <<case "Julia">>\
            <<nm $traitor "Tee-hee! Hehehehe, hahaha, mmmmm, y-you'll give it back? P-promise? Tee-hee!">>\

            <<nm $erik "I, uh... $james.name?">>\

            <<nm $james "Yes, yes. I believe when all this is said and done we'll be able to give you exactly what you want.">>\
    <</switch>>\

    ''With that, the meeting concludes, and all parties go their separate ways.''

    <<btnLink "Continue" "Room-Sleep">>


:: Story-CH4-FinishCMD2 {"position":"1100,25225","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Lab>>\

    ''You settle in after to work and start pulling together your notes regarding the specialty serum requested by $lisa.name. A few moments later, $penny.name enters the room and closes the door behind her.''

    <<pic $penny>>\

    <<nm $penny "Mornin' boss! Glad you're already here, I wanted to tell you I'd finished up my part for $lisa.name's request. How's your end coming along?">>\

    <<nm $player "Actually, great timing, I'm done, too!">>\

    <<nm $penny "Nice! Cool, so, I think all that's left at this point is the synthesizing process, right?">>\

    ''You nod, motioning for $penny.name to help you get the equipment set up. The two of you spend the rest of the morning finishing work on a single dose of concentrated serum.''

    <<nm $player "I think... It's done?">>\

    <<nm $penny "Looks like. Watcha gonna call it? Got any clever ideas?">>\

    ''You roll the vial in your hand for a moment, examining the light passing through it, before shrugging.''

    <<nm $player "CMD-2.">>\

    <<nm $penny "Lame.">>\

    <<nm $player "Yeah... Anyway, we should probably get this on ice, it'll take some time to stabilize.">>\

    <<nm $penny "Don't you wanna test it first?">>\

    ''You think for a second.''

    <<nm $player "Nah, as far as composition goes it's basically just a more condensed version of the CMD-1 serum... Plus Lenny's off today.">>\

    ''$penny.name glares at you.''

    <<nm $player "I'm kidding! I'll give $lisa.name a call and let her know it's done. We'll probably want to keep it in here and have her pick it up when she's ready for it.">>\

    <<nm $penny "Sounds like a plan, I'll get it in a locker.">>\

    ''$penny.name takes the vial to the back of the lab, locking it in chilled storage while you get $lisa.name on the phone.''

    <<nm $lisa "$player.name, what can I do for you?">>\

    <<nm $player "Hey, just wanted to let you know that $penny.name and I have finished with that thing you wanted. We're gonna hold it down here for you, is that okay?">>\

    ''There's a brief silence.''

    <<nm $lisa "That would be wonderful. I'll come by in a couple days, would that be alright?">>\

    <<nm $player "No problem, $penny.name or I will be here.">>\

    <<nm $lisa "Perfect, I'll see you soon.">>\

    ''$lisa.name hangs up the phone, you turn to $penny.name and give a thumbs up, which she acknowledges in kind.''

    @@.data;You've completed the CMD-2 for $lisa.name!@@

    <<SetFlag $player "CMD2">>\
    <<btnLink "Continue" "Work" "passTime()">>\


:: Story-CH4-SophieMeeting {"position":"1225,25225","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_SophieOffice>>\

    ''As you arrive at the building, you're immediately called to $sophie.name's office for a meeting with her and $lisa.name. You enter the room and find them both waiting for you.''

    <<pic $sophie>>\

    <<nm $sophie "Ah, $player.name, thanks for coming.">>\

    <<nm $lisa "Don't worry, this will be quick! Please, take a seat.">>\

    ''$lisa.name motions to an empty seat across from her and $sophie.name and passes you a warm cup of coffee.''

    <<pic $lisa>>\

    <<nm $lisa "Right, so, $sophie.name and I have a meeting scheduled with The Company's entire executive board at the end of the month... There's a lot of movement at the top of the chain right now and, I'll cut to the chase, it's been requested that you accompany us to this meeting.">>\

    ''You nearly spit out your coffee.''

    <<nm $player "You want ME at an executives board meeting? That's... slightly terrifying...">>\

    <<nm $sophie "That's an understandable response... The meeting is actually about the work that you're doing here, which is why you're coming along. I also wouldn't worry about anything too shady happening in a meeting with so many eyes watching.">>\

    <<nm $player "If it's about the lab work, shouldn't $penny.name be coming, too?">>\

    ''$lisa.name and $sophie.name look at each other.''

    <<nm $lisa "Given the sensitive nature of this meeting, it's best we don't have 'too' many eyes watching. Even you coming is an oddity, and likely a result of $sophie.name needing to step in an temporarily fill Tori's vacant seat.">>\

    <<nm $player "I see...">>\

    ''The three of you finish your drinks, and $sophie.name walks over to the door.''

    <<nm $sophie "The meeting will be held on the 26th of this month. You'll meet us at the station in the lower levels as soon as you arrive at the office.">>\

    <<nm $lisa "Additionally, please keep this meeting quiet. It would be best that no one outside those attending know about it.">>\

    <<nm $player "Yeah... sure...">>\

    ''$lisa.name stands up and approaches you before you can leave.''

    <<nm $lisa "Also, your little lab partner was kind enough to help me with that item I requested. Thank you both.">>\

    <<nm $player "Of course.">>\

    ''You leave $sophie.name's office, the doors closing immediately behind you, and go about your day.''

    <<Thought "Great, as if I wasn't already stressed out enough...">>\

    <<btnLink "Continue" "Work" "passTime()">>\


:: Story-CH4-CompanyHQ {"position":"100,25350","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_Rail>>\

    ''As instructed, you make your way down to the basement level, past The Pit and down to the underground rail. $sophie.name and $lisa.name are already on the train waiting for you.''

    <<pic $sophie>>\

    <<nm $sophie "Ah, $player.name, right on time.">>\

    <<nm $lisa "Are you ready for this?">>\

    ''You take your seat across from them as the door closes.''

    <<nm $player "I mean... Ready as I'll ever be.">>\

    ''With that, the three of you all sit back as the gasses fill the car and knock you out. After last time you had enough sense to get comfortable before losing consciousness. When you awaken again, it's to the hushed voices of $lisa.name and $sophie.name whispering by the door.''

    <<nm $sophie "You're sure you know what you're doing? This is recklessly dangerous, Lisa!">>\

    <<nm $lisa "What other choice do I have, Sophie? That man's going to destroy everything if we don't do anything, and... hm?">>\

    <<nm $player "Uunnnggghhh... hhuh?">>\

    ''You feel soft hands patting your face.''

    <<pic $lisa>>\

    <<nm $lisa "Aw, did you have a nice nap, sweetie? Well, time to wakey-wakey. We're here.">>\

    ''The train rolls to a slow stop and the doors open. Your vision starts coming back and you're helped to your feet by $sophie.name. The three of you walk towards the elevator where $lisa.name enters a code to take you to the executive floor.''

    <<btnLink "Continue" "CH4-CompanyHQ2">>\

    <<set $traitor.name to $traitor.identity>>\
    <<switch $traitor.identity>>\
        <<case "Penny">>\
            <<set $traitor.style to "penny">>\
            <<set $traitor.img to $penny.img>>\
            <<set $traitor.portrait to "Penny">>\
            <<set $traitor.sayaLine to "sweet, sweet $penny.name has revealed herself a filthy traitor!">>\
        <<case "Diana">>\
            <<set $traitor.style to "diana">>\
            <<set $traitor.img to $diana.img>>\
            <<set $traitor.portrait to "Diana">>\
            <<set $traitor.sayaLine to "poor $diana.name has betrayed you out of sheer desperation!">>\
        <<case "John">>\
            <<set $traitor.style to "john">>\
            <<set $traitor.img to $john.img>>\
            <<set $traitor.portrait to "John">>\
            <<set $traitor.sayaLine to "$john.name sold you all out for a pile of cash!">>\
        <<case "Julia">>\
            <<set $traitor.style to "julia">>\
            <<set $traitor.img to $julia.img>>\
            <<set $traitor.portrait to "Julia">>\
            <<set $traitor.sayaLine to "poor, stupid $julia.name found a way to fuck you after all!">>\
    <</switch>>\


:: CH4-CompanyHQ2 {"position":"225,25350","size":"100,100"}
<<loc_CompanyHQ>>\

    ''You're a little surprised when the door opens directly into the meeting room. $james.name and $erik.name are already seated at one side of the table, three open seats waiting on the other. The head of the table, likely where The Company's CEO sits, is vacant.''

    <<pic $npc "james">>\

    <<nm $james "Welcome! As expected, the old man won't be joining us today. He's still out of the country.">>\

    <<nm $lisa "Old man? Mmm, you should really show him some respect, you know?">>\

    ''$james.name laughs as you take your seats.''

    <<nm $james "A term of endearment, I assure you. Now then, let's not waste precious time. <<Formal>>, have these lovely ladies explained to you the purpose of this meeting?">>\

    ''$sophie.name looks at you, as if giving you approval to speak.''

    <<nm $player "I, um, yes, sorry. You wanted to discuss my research, right? The development of the serums we've been working on?">>\

    <<nm $erik "So, am I really to understand that you're working on some kind of super drug that can do everything from making people think the way you want them to, to straight up turning them into braindead cockwhores?">>\

    ''$lisa.name leans back in her chair, placing her hand on the table and clicking her nails.''

    <<nm $lisa "Well, you saw $tory.name, didn't you? How is she, anyway?">>\

    <<nm $james "Indisposed, I'm afraid. Now then, it's not just that, is it? If I'm understanding the situation correctly, you and your little lab partner have developed an honest to goodness mind control formula, haven't you? One simple injection and you'd have total control. Is that right?">>\

    <<nm $player "We're still refining that one, but, um...">>\

    <<nm $lisa "What exactly are you getting at, James?">>\

    ''$james.name leans over the table, locking eyes with you.''

    <<nm $james "Don't you think it's a waste, $player.name? The Company has, in some fashion or another, been around for hundreds of years, did you know that?">>\

    ''You shake your head.''

    <<nm $james "It's true! Iterations of The Company have catered to kings, queens, dictators and presidents, dealing in the highest class off the grid sex-trafficking for as long as there's been demand. As a result, we have near-infinite resources with which to operate, in exchange for complete anonymity.">>\

    <<pic $sophie>>\

    <<nm $sophie "Yes, seems like a good deal if you ask me, however shady our dealings may be.">>\

    <<nm $james "Hmph, small minds. $player.name, what you've created has the power to change everything. Why run the world from the shadows through bribery and blackmail when a few well-placed injections could literally put us right in the drivers seat!">>\

    ''$lisa.name stands up from her seat and starts slowly approaching $james.name.''

    <<nm $lisa "You're a fool, James. Our CEO's vision, and every leader before him, was to remain in the darkness because every one of them knew that all The Company needed was a whiff of exposure and we'd be finished. You're sitting in your chair sounding like some kind of super villain, well I can be dramatic too. At the end of the day, James, The Company is the purest kind of evil, and if you think for a second that we might be able to step out into the light, super serum or not, then I don't think you're fit to hold your post anymore.">>\

    <<nm $james "HURK!">>\

    ''The room falls deadly silent as $lisa.name slides a needle into $james.name's neck, emptying the contents of the syringe into his vein. His eyes grow wide as he looks up at the older woman, a look of fear washes over his face.''

    <<nm $lisa "Now, bite off your tongue.">>\

    ''$james.name nods slowly, preparing to comply, before looking back at $lisa.name.''

    <<nm $james "May I ask you one question, first?">>\

    <<nm $lisa "Hunh-">>\

    @@STICK!@@

    <<nm $james "Won't you please devote your body and mind to me, forever?">>\

    ''$lisa.name's voice is immediately cut off as the syringe empties itself into her neck. Holding the needle is a familiar face.''

    <<pic $traitor>>\

    <<if $traitor.identity is "Penny">>\
        <<nm $penny "Man, you were always such a bitch! Oh, hehe, heya boss!">>\

        <<nm $player "$penny.name? W-what the fuck?">>\

        <<nm $penny "Hey, hey! It's cool, we're still gonna be lab partners! I'm a little busy though, we'll catch up later, okay?">>\
    <<elseif $traitor.identity is "Diana">>\
        <<nm $diana "Mmm, sorry Lisa, I do hope you understand.">>\

        <<nm $sophie "$diana.name!? But why?">>\

        <<nm $diana "...It's nothing personal, Sophie, but they promised they'd fix me.">>\
    <<elseif $traitor.identity is "John">>\
        <<nm $john "Pfft, whadda dumb cunt. This was too easy.">>\

        <<nm $sophie "$john.name! Motherfu-">>\

        <<nm $john "Oh save it, bitch! Pretty soon all that mouth'll be good for is suckin' me off! Hahahaha!">>\
    <<else>>\
        <<nm $julia "H-haaa, haaaa... D-did I do good?">>\

        <<nm $erik "Hahaha, yes darling, you did good.">>\

        <<nm $julia "Tee-hee! Yay! Fuckies now?">>\
    <</if>>\

    ''You and $sophie.name are now standing up, backing towards the door. $james.name snaps his fingers.''

    <<nm $james "$lisa.name, please collect $sophie.name and take her to the holding cells.">>\

    <<nm $lisa "Yes, master." "N-no! Sophie, run!">>\

    ''$lisa.name circles the table with frightening speed, grabbing $sophie.name by the hair and dragging her out of the office. Her screams can be heard down the hall. Before you can try to run, $erik.name and $traitor.name block your escape.''

    <<nm $player "You're fucking insane!">>\

    <<nm $james "You think? Honestly, that's fine. It takes a measured amount of insanity to succeed in this business, no? Alas, our little coup aside, this is still our esteemed CEO's business for the time being, and so concludes //our// business. <<Formal>>, take some time to rest and process, and we'll call for you soon. Don't worry about Sophie, we'll take good care of her. $traitor.name, too! Erik?">>\

    ''Your eyes are locked with $james.name's, both enraged and terrified you try to speak.''

    <<nm $player "Y-you mother... fu-">>\

    @@THUD!@@

    ''A heavy blow to the back of your head sends your world spinning, then, darkness...''

    <<btnLink "Continue" "Story-CH4-Chapter5">>\


:: Story-CH4-Chapter5 {"position":"350,25350","size":"100,100"}
<center>\
        <h1><<timed 1s t8n>>__Chapter 5__<</timed>></h1>\
